<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I offer now without reserve</l><l>All that I am and all I have</l><l>Thy purpose to fulfill.</l><l>Oh, may the Lord accept and keep,</l><l>That henceforth I may only seek</l><l>To do the Father’s will.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>When I look back, what grief and shame</l><l>That I’ve brought none to trust Thy name,</l><l>Thy word I’ve locked within.</l><l>Oh, may the Lord anointing give</l><l>And richly through my being live,</l><l>That I may speak of Him.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>My gracious Lord has giv’n much grace,</l><l>Exceeding e’en a friend my place;</l><l>I fain would be His bride.</l><l>I’d share His life and suffer loss,</l><l>Accepting willingly the cross,</l><l>With Him identified.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
